OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey: Disruption amid
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices across Guernsey are facing
OL,7,Fdisruption due to the Microsoft global
OL,8,Foutage.
OL,10,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot
OL,11,Fhave been affected and Microsoft said
OL,12,Fattempts to fix the issue so far were
OL,13,F"not taking as expected". More than 400
OL,14,Fmillion people are known to use
OL,15,FMicrosoft 365 services.
OL,17,FIn a post on social media, Guernsey's
OL,18,Fairline Aurigny said the outage may
OL,19,Faffect some of its communication
OL,20,Fchannels, advising customers to
OL,21,Fmanually take notes of their details
OL,22,Fwhilst making a booking.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
